abstract: "Physics-based design framework for brackish-groundwater and seawater RO desalination (Egyptian feed-water presets), with ML surrogates, Bayesian optimization, NSGA-II multi-objective optimization, a deep-learning large-scale surrogate, a reinforcement-learning multi-site allocator, and external-validation and statistical-validation scripts."
